  - id: keeping_his_commandments
    displayName: Keeping His Commandments
    flavorText: He teaches that true knowledge of God is proven by keeping his commandments,
      epitomized in the old-yet-new commandment to love one's brother.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Teaches that true knowledge of God and abiding in him is proven by keeping
      his commandments, epitomized in an 'old yet new' commandment to love one's
      brother; loving a brother is equated with walking in the light, and hating
      a brother with remaining in darkness.
    deliveredByManagerId: author_1_john
    managerId: keeping_his_commandments
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
