  - id: fathers_young_men_little_children
    displayName: Fathers, Young Men, and Little Children
    flavorText: He addresses little children, fathers, and young men in turn, assuring
      each group of forgiveness, knowledge of the Father from the beginning, and
      victory over the wicked one.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: A brief poetic passage of assurance addressed in turn to three groups
      of believers at different stages of spiritual maturity, affirming forgiveness
      of sins, knowledge of God 'from the beginning,' and victory over 'the wicked
      one' through the abiding word of God.
    deliveredByManagerId: author_1_john
    managerId: fathers_young_men_little_children
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 140.52906339306293
