    managerUnlockCost: 0
    submanagers: []
  - id: the_many_antichrists
    displayName: The Many Antichrists
    flavorText: He warns that it is the last time, that many antichrists denying
      Jesus is the Christ have already gone out from among them, while an anointing
      from the Holy One teaches believers truth.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Warns that 'it is the last time' and that many antichrists \u2014 false
      teachers who deny that Jesus is the Christ and who 'went out from us' \u2014
      have already appeared; reassures believers of an 'unction from the Holy One'
      that teaches them truth directly, and urges them to let what they heard 'from
      the beginning' remain in them."
    deliveredByManagerId: author_1_john
    managerId: the_many_antichrists
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
