  - id: children_of_god
    displayName: Children of God
    flavorText: He contrasts children of God with children of the devil, promising
      that believers shall be made like Christ when he appears, since sin is the
      transgression of the law.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Contrasts children of God with children of the devil; teaches the hope
      of one day being made like Christ 'when he shall appear,' and that sin (defined
      as 'the transgression of the law') is incompatible with abiding in Christ,
      while practicing righteousness and loving one's brother are the visible marks
      of God's children.
    deliveredByManagerId: author_1_john
    managerId: children_of_god
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
